<title>USA: Bankers Trust names Paul Volcker director.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust names Paul Volcker director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust New York Corp and its main subsidiary, Bankers Trust Company, said on Tuesday they named Paul Volcker, former chairman of the Federal Reserve's Board of Governors, as a company director.</p>
<p>Volcker was most recently chairman and chief executive of investment bank Wolfensohn &amp; Co, which merged with Bankers Trust this year.</p>
<p>He served in the federal goverment for nearly 30 years, including two terms as Federal Reserve Board chairman.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
